    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about taking a break though. i mean, even when i'm alone, i'm still stuck in this body and this life. the world is so hostile to people like me. it feels like there's no actual version of the future where i can just... exist without it being a constant battle. it's just so heavy.",
